  <ul class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"28">
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"28"><strong>M=C3=A3 NL:</strong><sp=
an>&nbsp;</span>Sinh theo Material Config (d=E1=BB=B1a tr=C3=AAn Lo=E1=BA=
=A1i v=C3=A0 =C4=90=E1=BA=B7c t=C3=ADnh).</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"29"><strong>M=C3=A3 L=C3=B4:</stron=
g><span>&nbsp;</span>Sinh m=E1=BB=9Bi 100% cho m=E1=BB=97i item (Serial ID)=
 =C4=91=E1=BB=83 qu=E1=BA=A3n l=C3=BD v=E1=BA=BFt.</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"31" id=3D"id-=E2=9C=85CS1.E=
