 &amp; BR-04)</h3>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"32">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"32" data-uuid=3D"89618c95-b962-4381-8=
6d5-fa1e9ae11388"><strong>When:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Ng=C6=B0=E1=BB=
