=BB=91ng t=E1=BB=B1 =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng t=C3=ADnh:=20
  <ul class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"34">
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"34"><strong>Tu=E1=BB=95i (Purity):<=
/strong><span>&nbsp;</span>D=E1=BB=B1a tr=C3=AAn Material Type (V=C3=A0ng l=
=E1=BA=A5y %Au, B=E1=BA=A1c l=E1=BA=A5y %Ag, =C4=90=E1=BB=93ng l=E1=BA=A5y =
%Cu).</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"35"><strong>TL kim lo=E1=BA=A1i:</s=
trong><span>&nbsp;</span>=3D TL sau =C4=91o.</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"36"><strong>Quy 99.99:</strong><spa=
n>&nbsp;</span>=3D TL kim lo=E1=BA=A1i * Tu=E1=BB=95i / 99.99.</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"38" id=3D"id-=E2=9C=85CS1.E=
4.US06:[X=E1=BB=ADl=C3=BDNL]Qu=E1=BA=A3nl=C3=BD=C4=90oph=E1=BB=95&amp;Nh=E1=
