d7e-116ca89fff83"><strong>When:</strong><span>&nbsp;</span>Nh=C3=A2n vi=C3=
=AAn t=C3=ADch ch=E1=BB=8Dn<span>&nbsp;</span><code>[ ] In nh=C3=A3n NL</co=
de><span>&nbsp;</span>v=C3=A0 b=E1=BA=A5m "Nh=E1=BA=ADp kho".</li>
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"40" data-uuid=3D"e5074e08-be80-4cd4-b=
f17-5232281be8cc"><strong>Then:</strong>
  <ul class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"41">
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"41">Ch=E1=BB=91t s=E1=BB=91 li=E1=
=BB=87u, sinh giao d=E1=BB=8Bch kho (Inventory Transactions).</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"42">T=E1=BB=B1 =C4=91=E1=BB=99ng =
=C4=91=E1=BA=A9y l=E1=BB=87nh in tem cho t=E1=BA=A5t c=E1=BA=A3 c=C3=A1c it=
em trong Grid.</li>
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"43">Chuy=E1=BB=83n tr=E1=BA=A1ng th=
=C3=A1i phi=E1=BA=BFu g=E1=BB=91c sang<span>&nbsp;</span><code>Ho=C3=A0n th=
=C3=A0nh</code>.</li>
  </ul></li>
</ul>
<hr class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"45">
<h2 class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"47" id=3D"id-=E2=9C=85CS1.E=
