=E1=BA=BET K=E1=BA=BE (UX/UI) *</h2>
<ul class=3D"code-line" style=3D"" data-line=3D"49">
 <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"49" data-uuid=3D"123f4a70-2d3b-43af-8=
aa5-b9631bda6c47"><strong>M=C3=B4 t=E1=BA=A3 Layout:</strong>
  <ul class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"50">
   <li class=3D"code-line" data-line=3D"50">Header: Hi=E1=BB=83n th=E1=BB=
=8B th=C3=B4ng tin phi=E1=BA=BFu g=E1=BB=91c (M=C3=A3 phi=E1=BA=BFu, Ng=C6=
